+/* MCS-51 symbols are case insensitive (acc.7 is the same as Acc.7 and
+   ACC.7), which gas implements by folding every symbol name to upper case
+   as it is created.  This has to be turned on from tc_init_after_args
+   rather than from md_begin: gas_init () defines the --defsym symbols
+   before md_begin () runs, so setting it any later leaves those names
+   unfolded and unreachable from the source.  */
